# Machine facts and backups: never tracked (privacy rule).
cmem/local/

# Open review issues stay local (review standard).
cmem/review-issues.md

# Generated measurement output: the scripts and the .out summaries are tracked, the dumps are not.
tools/assembler-parity/*/

# Session and editor state.
.claude/
.vscode/

# What macOS writes on a drive that is not its own format.
.DS_Store
._*
